title: "OUSD Consent Tracker: Oakland Unified School District Board of Education consent agenda items"
abstract: >-
  Every item on the Oakland Unified School District Board of Education's
  General Consent Report since August 2025, from Legistar, with plain-English
  summaries, classifications and dollar amounts checked in code, plus the
  pipeline that keeps it current.
